      "text": {
        "en": "A strong majority of reviewers praise the staff for their friendly greeting, helpful advice on canine nutrition, and welcoming attitude. While a few isolated complaints mention rigid vaccination verification or scheduling friction, clients generally describe the team as courteous."
      }
    },
    {
