      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient handling for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the groomers for their patience when working with rescue dogs, senior canines with mobility challenges, and pets sensitive to paw handling. Reviewers note that staff take time to soothe anxious animals, ensuring baths and trims proceed smoothly."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Convenient self-wash and retail facilities"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers appreciate the well-maintained self-service dog washing tubs, high-velocity dryers, and quality canine feed supplies. While an occasional visitor encountered restricted wash station hours near closing, most owners describe the premises as clean and well organised."
      }
    }
  ],
